WEBVTT

NOTE
Balamb Garden lifts off and becomes a mobile vessel.
Duration: approximately 40 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Balamb Garden tears loose from its foundations.

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:14.510
An immense ring of dust and debris spreads across the fields.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:28.220
The white-and-gold ringed structure rises out of the billowing cloud.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.100
It lifts into the air, now a mobile vessel.
